OL,3,AMilitary veterans told they owe
OL,4,Athousands of pounds over clerical error
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of former members of the
OL,7,Fmilitary have had their pensions
OL,8,Fslashed after receiving letters telling
OL,9,Fthem to repay thousands of pounds
OL,10,Fbecause of a clerical error.
OL,12,FThe Ministry of Defence (MoD) confirmed
OL,13,Fto the BBC that more than 1000 retired
OL,14,Fservice personnel are being pursued for
OL,15,Fdebts. The majority, 335 veterans, were
OL,16,Foverpaid a total of #5.1m as a result
OL,17,Fof incorrect National Insurance
OL,18,Fcalculations.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
