OL,3,AMilitary veterans told they owe
OL,4,Athousands of pounds over clerical error
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Forces Pension Society said it is
OL,7,Faware of a small number of veterans
OL,8,Fwhose debts were wiped after raising a
OL,9,Fformal complaint.
OL,11,FRay Lawton, 70, was told in July he
OL,12,Fowed #8,000 following six years of
OL,13,Foverpayments. Days later, his monthly
OL,14,Fmilitary pension was cut from #550 to
OL,15,F#365.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
